# Claude Code agent memory #
############################
# Local-only notes (contains personal env details such as NetID / SSH config).
# Shared conventions belong in CLAUDE.md, which IS tracked.
.claude/memory/
quest_pull.log

# AwareBench local --limit smoke tests: evidence for one session, never a result (aware_eval_core.results_dir)
Transition_processes_benchmarks/Awareness_in_LLM/AWARE_*/smoke/
Transition_processes_benchmarks/Awareness_in_LLM/AWARE_*/smoke_rep*/
Transition_processes_benchmarks/Awareness_in_LLM/AWARE_*/smoke_log.txt

# Judge pilot (Action_processes_benchmarks): --limit smoke runs, never a result; the sampled
# Wonderbread demos (278 MB, re-fetchable from Zenodo by fetch_sample_demos.py); and the SOP text
# files upstream's run() writes beside our rows — the .jsonl next to them holds the same text.
Action_processes_benchmarks/*/*/smoke/
Action_processes_benchmarks/judge_comparison/smoke/
Action_processes_benchmarks/Wonderbread_bench/data/demos/
Action_processes_benchmarks/Wonderbread_bench/WB_GPT_5.6_Luna/results/sop_upstream_files/
# judge_core.lock_output: one writer per result file; the lock is process state, never a result
Action_processes_benchmarks/**/*.jsonl.lock
